OL,3,GNEWSACare home celebrates five
OL,4,A'fantastic' centenarians
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home has held a party for five
OL,7,F"fantastic" residents who are now 100
OL,8,Fyears old or older.
OL,10,FKnellwood Care Home in Farnborough,
OL,11,FHampshire, brought out a special cake
OL,12,Fin celebration of Dorothy, Margaret
OL,13,FCosh and Margaret McBain, who are all
OL,14,F100.
OL,16,FThey were joined by friends and
OL,17,Frelatives in their celebrations, along
OL,18,Fwith Portsmouth-born Mollie, who is now
OL,19,F101, and 102-year-old Aida.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
