OL,3,GNEWSACare home celebrates five
OL,4,A'fantastic' centenarians
OL,5,
OL,6,FMargaret McBain put her longevity down
OL,7,Fto being Welsh, and said she lived by
OL,8,Fthe phrase: "Laugh and the world laughs
OL,9,Fwith you. Cry and you cry alone."
